WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
Serial Animation

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:11.490
I have abandoned my temple.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.830
For countless days, I have journeyed...

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.750
in search of a land I know only by name.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:39.010
I have arrived here at Adachigahara.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.020
Chapter One

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:24.050
My lord.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:27.470
These men are not of the Kamakura army.

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.430
Indeed. However...

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.980
Your elder brother is not the only one who desires the head of Minamoto no Yoshitsune.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:39.440
There are many others who pursue you.

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:41.730
It appears so.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:46.740
The Genji who wrested this country from the Heike Clan...

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.370
Indeed, I have become a thorn in their side.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:51.620
Benkei,

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.410
if you were to take my head and flee,

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.370
your life would be spared at the very least.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.830
My lord!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.800
We have lived and fought for long enough.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.920
That is why...

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.170
This place is satisfactory.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.050
To think you would utter such words...

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.220
What stirs you so, Benkei?

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:14.770
My lord.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.560
I espied a fire over there.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.230
A fire? Our pursuers, perhaps?

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:19.980
No.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.190
The fire appears to be stationary.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.440
A lantern in a dwelling, perhaps.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:28.820
There are people who live in
mountains as remote as these?

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:34.200
They are perhaps kindred spirits seeking to escape the world of mankind.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.660
It is growing dark...

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.210
and we have almost run out of water.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.540
If it is indeed shelter,

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.540
we shall request admittance for the night.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.880
However, as a precaution,

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:48.550
I, Benkei, shall use my lord's name Kuro as a pretense.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.210
It appears to be deserted.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:24.880
Hello?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:31.090
Are there any souls residing here?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.220
There are.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.030
Do you require assistance?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.210
Who are you?

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:05.920
Pardon my rudeness.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:10.090
We are monks of Kishu, on a pilgrimage from the Kumano shrine.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.880
I am known as Priest Kuro.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.890
While traversing these
mountains, darkness fell upon us.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:20.890
If you would allow us, whether it be on squalid floor or beneath the eaves,

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.400
could we sojourn here for the night?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.610
By no means do we wish to—

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:31.780
Your traveling companion has...

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.540
What ails you?

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.000
Such a rampant fever.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.500
Such a wretched state.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:52.880
What's the matter?

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.140
Then, this is your disciple?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:57.930
Yes.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:05.980
You display a refinement which cannot be concealed, despite your efforts.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.900
He attends to you as a vassal would.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.200
I will allow you to stay the night.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:26.210
I have one stipulation, however, in return for your sojourn.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:30.250
There lies a room deep within this house.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.010
That is where I repose,

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.220
and is always unsightly.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:41.520
I request that you never glance inside.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.640
Such a facile request...

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:44.940
We agree to your stipulation.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:48.810
If you keep your word,

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:54.650
you may remain here as long as you wish.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.070
Please tell me your name.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.830
I am called Kuromitsu.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.840
Has his complexion not improved?

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.430
Regrettably not.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.930
I will descend the mountain and purchase medicine.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.350
Until I return, please watch over him.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.020
I will do as you ask.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.280
Your fever appears to be subsiding.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:23.530
Have you been attending all this time?

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.040
Yes.

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:41.130
We were merely promised one night.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.930
As soon as my companion returns, I will leave immediately.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:46.680
Please do not.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.310
Should you wish it,

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:55.150
you may reside here as long as you desire.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.990
As long as you desire...

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:35.020
How is your health?

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:45.870
This place...

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:49.330
seems unusual compared to the world I have come from.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.790
Even our sense of time dissipates into a perplexing conundrum.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.290
Consider this tree.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.500
It has existed for a thousand years.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.850
What troubles you, Kuromitsu?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.680
I regret that...

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:13.980
you feel uncomfortable in this place.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.010
Forgive my impertinence.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.720
I was gripped by a fit of madness.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.440
We cannot.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.730
However much we are drawn together...

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:03.530
You and I...

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:08.200
We are fated to live apart.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.870
I sense a presence.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.130
Has Benkei returned?

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.250
No, it cannot be.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.380
If it were Benkei, he would have come here first.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.510
Our pursuers?

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:14.970
I hear something...

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:29.530
It came from within.

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:29.710
<i>I request that you never glance inside.</i>

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.040
Why have you come here?!

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:14.590
How wretched you must think me.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:19.640
Yet, this is how it must be.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.520
For I knew this day would eventually come.

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:27.060
Perhaps...

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:30.780
I even longed for it, deep in my heart,

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:35.110
for you to see me committing such an atrocious act.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:40.950
Kuromitsu.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.870
I will not divulge what I have seen today to anyone—

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:56.300
Kuromitsu!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.820
You cur!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:41.530
Your head is mine, Yoshitsune.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.550
Immortal, you claim?

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:07.100
You believe that woman to be immortal?

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.100
Indeed.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.350
That maiden...

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:14.860
Hundreds of years have passed and yet, she remains ageless.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.690
An indubitable immortal.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:23.870
My clan has sought this maiden since Heian-kyou was constructed.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:29.370
And what are your intentions once you obtain her?

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.000
We will unravel...

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.210
the secret to everlasting life.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.600
Are you mortally wounded?

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.230
More importantly, what of your injuries?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.020
Your right arm was...

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.360
Your...

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.740
This body of mine is unusual.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.990
So unusual and wretched.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.750
At the very least, I wished for you to remain ignorant of that fact.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.170
Kuromitsu.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.670
My time is short.

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:25.010
My fate will abandon me in these mountains.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.970
Leave me here...

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.230
and flee from this place.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.370
My beloved Kuro.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:52.410
Will you accompany me?

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:57.250
To where?

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:05.050
To the end of time.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:28.110
Next Chapter

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:28.110
The
Star-crossed
Mound
